// Tabela calculada alternativa para o Calendario (caso prefira DAX a M).
// Modelagem > Nova tabela > colar:
Calendario =
ADDCOLUMNS (
    CALENDAR ( DATE ( 2020, 1, 1 ), DATE ( 2025, 12, 31 ) ),
    "Ano", YEAR ( [Date] ),
    "MesNum", MONTH ( [Date] ),
    "MesNome", FORMAT ( [Date], "MMM", "pt-BR" ),
    "AnoMes", FORMAT ( [Date], "yyyy-MM" ),
    "Trimestre", "T" & QUARTER ( [Date] )
)
